{"v":4,"catch":"使用各種強化物品在各個關卡中殺出一條血路！","desc":"《MAD SHARK》是ALLUMER於1993年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n玩家控制戰鬥機對抗無數敵人。\n當你在關卡中奮力拼搏時，使用具有各種效果的炸彈和強化物品以獲得優勢。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-08-10","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a4ead71b176430949c10fe7685e1ec41a28e04eefdde9eab9f65ce69fe8a40a5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c9459d183f8bfe02d3c851134af19d74b8d2c3da013430a1a508f97d7f82f1fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f97d43b3177f959062ea19fb5d6d7ee20e1fea22cf07d7f1bc12c2cb01c2494b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d77374d1d90e08dbc5d96365e9486dddb365e5fa4188a8e2802143613c68147.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef1c6093435b33e220a46657bb3b1f112c224c6f8289c2f8e1945dbb2444a406.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1246cc9d593ea5304f151a9604bd1d35d175fed6cd78cded2411eb7735585f4a.jpg"],"titleId":"01004f701bd80000","dlc":[]}